{"strongs": "H0929", "word": "בְּהֵמָה", "translit": "be.he.mah", "root": "בהמה", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "beast, animal, cattle", "definition": "בְּהֵמָה 187 noun feminine beast, animal, cattle (Arabic ) — ׳ בּ Gen 1:24 + 137 t.; construct בֶּהֱמַת Num 3:41 (twice in verse) + 10 t.; suffix בְּהֶמְתְּךָ Lev 19:19 + 4 t.; בְּהֶמְתֶּ֑ךָ Exod 20:10 + 4 t.; בְּהֶמְתּוֺ Gen 36:6 ; Prov 12:10 plural absolute בְּהֵמוֺת Deut 32:24 + 6 t. + Ps 73:22 (see below); construct בַּהֲמוֺת Ps 8:8 + 5 t.; — beast , & collective beasts ( Gen 8:1 + very often) 1. of living creatures other than man ( אָדָם ) Gen 8:1 ; Exod 8:13 ; Exod 8:14 ; Exod 9:9 ; Exod 9:10 ; Exod 9:22 ; Exod 22:18 ; Lev 18:23 (twice in verse) (where ׳ בּ is male, so Lev 20:16 ) Deut 27:21 ; Ps 36:7 etc.; ׳ מֵאָדָם וְעַד בּ ( ׳ בּ including all the larger animals) Exod 9:25 ; Exod 12:12 ; Ps 135:8 ; Jer 50:3 etc.; as inferior to man Job 18:3 ; Ps 49:13 ; Ps 49:21 , so also Eccl 3:18 ; Eccl 3:19 (twice in verse); Eccl 3:21 opposed to also birds & reptiles Gen 6:7 ; Gen 7:23 ; Gen 8:17 compare Ezek 44:31 etc.; also to fishes 1Kgs 5:13 ; Job 12:7 compare v Job 12:8 , Ps 8:9 ; Zeph 1:3 . 2. opposed to also to wild beasts חַיַּת הָאָרֶץ , הַשָּׂדֶה ׳ ח Gen 1:24 ; Gen 1:25 ; Gen 1:26 ; Gen 2:20 ; Gen 3:14 ; Gen 7:14 ; Gen 7:21 ; Gen 9:10 ; Ps 50:10 ; Ps 148:10 ; Isa 46:1 etc.; especially therefore cattle , as owned and used by man, Gen 47:18 ( ׳ מִקְנֵה הַבּ ) Exod 20:10 = Deut 5:14 ; Lev 19:19 ; Lev 26:22 ; Num 3:41 (twice in verse); Num 3:45 (twice in verse); Deut 2:35 ; Deut 11:15 ; Jonah 4:11 ; Zech 2:8 ; Zech 8:10 ; Zech 14:15 ; Neh 10:37 etc.; in one (late) passage of animal for riding (horse ? mule ?) Neh 2:12 (twice in verse); Neh 2:14 . 3. rarely of wild beasts , especially carnivora, יַעַר ׳ בּ Mic 5:7 הָאָרֶץ ׳ בּ Deut 28:26 ; Isa 18:6 (twice in verse); Jer 7:33 ; Jer 15:3 ; Jer 16:4 ; Jer 19:7 ; Jer 34:20 הַשָּׂדֶה ׳ בּ 1Sam 17:44 alone, Prov 30:30 שֶׁןבְּֿהֵמוֺת Deut 32:24 ׳ שֹׁד בּ Hab 2:17 . — On בְּהֵמוֺת Ps 73:22 compare below", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB936')\">BDB936</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H929')\">H929</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB935')\">BDB935</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB937')\">BDB937</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>בְּהֵמָה</bdbheb><sub>187</sub> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>beast, animal, cattle</highlightword> (Arabic <placeholder514/>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 1:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,24)\">Gen 1:24</ref> + 137 t.; construct <bdbheb>בֶּהֱמַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 3:41\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,41)\">Num 3:41</ref> (twice in verse) + 10 t.; suffix <bdbheb>בְּהֶמְתְּךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 19:19\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(3,19,19)\">Lev 19:19</ref> + 4 t.; <bdbheb>בְּהֶמְתֶּ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 20:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,10)\">Exod 20:10</ref> + 4 t.; <bdbheb>בְּהֶמְתּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 36:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,36,6)\">Gen 36:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 12:10\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,10)\">Prov 12:10</ref> plural absolute <bdbheb>בְּהֵמוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,24)\">Deut 32:24</ref> + 6 t. + <ref ref=\"Ps 73:22\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,22)\">Ps 73:22</ref> (see below); construct <bdbheb>בַּהֲמוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 8:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,8,8)\">Ps 8:8</ref> + 5 t.; — <highlight>beast</highlight>, &amp; collective <highlight>beasts</highlight> (<ref ref=\"Ge