=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,8,9)\">Ps 8:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zeph 1:3\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(36,1,3)\">Zeph 1:3</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> opposed to also to wild beasts <bdbheb>חַיַּת הָאָרֶץ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>הַשָּׂדֶה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 1:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,24)\">Gen 1:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 1:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,25)\">Gen 1:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 1:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,26)\">Gen 1:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 2:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,20)\">Gen 2:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 3:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,14)\">Gen 3:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 7:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,14)\">Gen 7:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 7:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,21)\">Gen 7:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 9:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,9,10)\">Gen 9:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 50:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,10)\">Ps 50:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 148:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"148\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"148\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,148,10)\">Ps 148:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 46:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,46,1)\">Isa 46:1</ref> etc.; especially therefore <highlight>cattle</highlight>, as owned and used by man, <ref ref=\"Gen 47:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,18)\">Gen 47:18</ref> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִקְנֵה הַבּ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Exod 20:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"2